WEBVTT

00:00:09.744 --> 00:00:11.329
(ALARM RINGING)

00:00:13.956 --> 00:00:15.416
(YAWNS)

00:00:15.875 --> 00:00:16.834
-(THUDS)
-(GROANS)

00:00:16.918 --> 00:00:18.336
Ow. Mmm.

00:00:20.046 --> 00:00:21.047
Ah.

00:00:23.508 --> 00:00:24.717
Let's go to work!
开工了！

00:00:28.054 --> 00:00:29.847
And cue the crazy old lizard.
传令那神经兮兮的老蜥蜴

00:00:29.931 --> 00:00:31.599
Good morning, Mr. Moon.
早上好 穆恩先生

00:00:31.682 --> 00:00:34.393
Indeed it is, Miss Crawly.
Top of the morning to you.
这真是美好的早晨 克劳利小姐

00:00:34.477 --> 00:00:36.270
I made you some coffee.
我为你冲了杯咖啡

00:00:36.354 --> 00:00:38.022
You did? Where is it?
是吗？在哪里？

00:00:38.147 --> 00:00:41.734
Oh. I got a little thirsty
on the way up those stairs.
我上楼时感到有点口渴

00:00:42.318 --> 00:00:45.196
-Shall I go open the doors now?
-The doors?
-我该现在开启大门吗？
-大门？

00:00:45.321 --> 00:00:48.783
You've got a lot of animals
waiting in line to audition, Mr. Moon.
有很多动物正等着面试　穆恩先生

00:00:48.866 --> 00:00:49.909
I do?
是吗？

00:00:52.537 --> 00:00:54.622
Holy moly, I really do.
糟糕 真是如此

00:00:54.830 --> 00:00:56.582
(EXCITED CHATTER)

00:00:58.084 --> 00:01:00.253
I swear to you, Eddie! This is no joke!
我对你发誓 艾迪！
这可不是闹着玩的！

00:01:00.336 --> 00:01:03.548
Look, just get down here
and see for yourself! I gotta go.
你亲自来这里看看吧！不说了

00:01:03.714 --> 00:01:05.174
(LAUGHS) This is it, Miss Crawly!
是时候了 克劳利小姐！

00:01:05.258 --> 00:01:09.387
Get your scaly tail downstairs
and throw those doors open wide!
快爬下楼开启那扇大门！

00:01:10.179 --> 00:01:11.847
(ANIMALS CHEERING)

00:01:19.230 --> 00:01:22.775
Okay, um, one at a time, please. Calm down.
好的 一个一个来 冷静点

00:01:23.192 --> 00:01:24.944
(ALL SINGING POP SONG)

00:01:32.493 --> 00:01:34.537
(SINGING POP SONG)

00:01:40.626 --> 00:01:42.628
(ALL SINGING ROCK SONG)

00:01:44.839 --> 00:01:46.132
Bye, Iggy. Bye, Perry. Bye, Carla.
再见伊希 再见派瑞 再见卡拉

00:01:46.257 --> 00:01:47.633
Bye, Gail. Bye, Rory. Bye, Micky.
再见戈尔 再见罗莉 再见米奇

00:01:47.717 --> 00:01:49.302
Bye, Moe. Bye, Nelson. Bye, Hannah.
再见莫尔 再见诺森 再见汉娜

00:01:49.385 --> 00:01:51.304
Bye, Tess. Bye-bye, Caspar.
再见泰思 再见卡斯帕

00:01:51.554 --> 00:01:52.555
Phew!

00:02:02.523 --> 00:02:04.358
(SINGING R&B SONG)

00:02:07.903 --> 00:02:09.488
(SINGING UPBEAT POP SONG)

00:02:13.242 --> 00:02:16.412
(SINGING BARBERSHOP SONG)

00:02:16.537 --> 00:02:18.623
(SINGING RAP ROCK SONG)

00:02:21.042 --> 00:02:23.753
Uh, let's hear from a few more
of the folks in line.
我们来访问排队的这些人

00:02:23.836 --> 00:02:24.795
What about you, sir?
你好 先生？

00:02:24.879 --> 00:02:26.505
Well, Bob, I'm a lab technician
是这样的 鲍比
我是制药公司的实验室技术员...

00:02:26.589 --> 00:02:28.090
for a leading pharmaceutical company,
是这样的 鲍比
我是制药公司的实验室技术员...

00:02:28.174 --> 00:02:30.009
but I was born with a gift.
但我有一项天赋

00:02:30.092 --> 00:02:31.927
And that gift is to sing!
那就是歌唱！

00:02:32.053 --> 00:02:37.016
(SCATTING)

00:02:37.141 --> 00:02:40.686
(SINGING POP SONG)

00:02:43.397 --> 00:02:44.732
(SINGING HARD ROCK SONG)

00:02:55.409 --> 00:02:57.328
(PLAYING FOLK MUSIC)

00:02:57.411 --> 00:02:59.830
(TUNING GUITAR)

00:03:06.212 --> 00:03:09.507
(SINGING POP SONG)

00:03:11.842 --> 00:03:13.511
Oi, Dad! Just going out.
爸爸！我出门了

00:03:13.594 --> 00:03:16.138
Well, don't be long.
I got the gang coming over.
别出去太久 我约了大伙过来

00:03:22.186 --> 00:03:23.604
Look, I'm sure you're gonna get
这当中肯定有很多
微不足道的动物来参赛...

00:03:23.688 --> 00:03:24.855
a lot of namby-pamby animals in here,
这当中肯定有很多
微不足道的动物来参赛...

00:03:24.939 --> 00:03:25.940
saying things like,
还说着以下的话...

00:03:26.107 --> 00:03:28.484
"Oh, it's not winning.
It's the taking part that counts."
“输赢不重要 参与就是一种肯定”

00:03:28.567 --> 00:03:30.945
Yeah, yeah. Not me, pal. I'm here to win.
我才不会这样说 朋友 我势在必得

00:03:31.028 --> 00:03:32.947
That prize, it's mine!
那个大奖是属于我的！

00:03:33.280 --> 00:03:36.367
(RAPPING)

00:03:38.452 --> 00:03:40.705
(SINGING POP SONG)

00:03:43.374 --> 00:03:44.834
(SINGING NEW WAVE SONG)

00:03:44.917 --> 00:03:47.962
(SINGING LATIN DANCE-POP SONG)

00:03:48.087 --> 00:03:53.342
(OPERATIC SINGING)

00:03:53.592 --> 00:03:57.388
(SINGING ROCK SONG)

00:03:57.513 --> 00:04:03.102
(SINGING SOUL SONG)

00:04:03.227 --> 00:04:08.107
(SINGING R&B SONG)

00:04:13.612 --> 00:04:15.656
Wow! Thank you, Johnny.
哇！谢谢你 强尼

00:04:16.782 --> 00:04:19.952
MISS CRAWLY: Okay, next up we have Meena.
好的 接下来的是米娜

00:04:20.035 --> 00:04:21.120
Good luck out there.
祝你好运

00:04:21.203 --> 00:04:22.705
All right, come on.
Here we go. Come on, you can do it.
来吧 你可以的

00:04:22.830 --> 00:04:24.039
You can do it. Okay.
你可以的 好的

00:04:24.123 --> 00:04:25.124
(MIC FEEDBACK)
你可以的 好的

00:04:25.291 --> 00:04:26.333
Oh, I'm sorry.
抱歉

00:04:27.543 --> 00:04:29.712
Okay. Hey, it's all right.
You know, it's all right.
嘿 没关系 真的没关系

00:04:29.795 --> 00:04:30.963
Take it away, Meena!
开始吧 米娜！

00:04:31.130 --> 00:04:32.923
(MUSIC PLAYING)

00:04:33.966 --> 00:04:36.510
Uh... Okay. Uh...
好的

00:04:37.303 --> 00:04:38.679
Anytime, now.
你可以随时开始

00:04:38.804 --> 00:04:39.805
Um...

00:04:41.432 --> 00:04:42.641
BUSTER: Do you wanna start over?
你要重来一次吗？

00:04:42.725 --> 00:04:44.518
-Um...
-(HEART BEATING)
你要重来一次吗？

00:04:44.602 --> 00:04:46.604
MIKE: All right, enough of that!
That's quite enough of that.
好了 够了！

00:04:46.771 --> 00:04:47.813
That's it. Come on.
就这样 走吧

00:04:47.897 --> 00:04:49.106
Off the stage, Helga.
下台吧 娜米

00:04:49.356 --> 00:04:51.066
Go on, you're useless. Thanks.
走吧 你真没用 不谢了

00:04:51.317 --> 00:04:53.027
Right. Here we go. Hit it!
好的 来吧

00:04:53.110 --> 00:04:54.695
(MUSIC PLAYING)
开始！

00:04:57.406 --> 00:04:59.950
(SINGING SWING SONG)

00:05:10.127 --> 00:05:12.171
(INDISTINCT CHATTER)
（穆恩剧场 面试从早上九点开始）

00:05:15.216 --> 00:05:16.634
(GRUNTS)

00:05:18.052 --> 00:05:22.848
(SINGING POP SONG)

